Package: singbox-panel
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), libpam0g, systemd, iproute2
Suggests: sing-box
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: web panel for the sing-box client (TUN) on a headless server
 Small self-contained web interface for managing a sing-box client:
 status, traffic and device load, start/stop/restart, subscription import,
 manual server selection, routing rules, systemd CPU/RAM limits,
 config editor with validation and backups, and sing-box binary updates.
 Optional (buttons only, fully reversible): LAN gateway mode, a built-in
 SOCKS5/HTTP proxy inbound in sing-box, and a localhost-only switch.
 .
 Login uses system accounts (PAM). Runs as root, intended for a trusted LAN.
 Only Python 3 standard library is used; nothing is downloaded at install time.
